 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Cycling helmet cut from 287 models to 20, chosen from the Virginia Tech top lists as reported by BikeRadar (road, MTB, urban; Bontrager Rally kept from old data); the 6 placeholder style entries became t types. Kask, Bell, Smith, Troy Lee Designs and Oakley helmets not in the 20 (not on the VT top lists fetched). Shoes: kept Shimano RC302/RC703/S-Phyre RC903, dropped RC503 and RC910 (superseded), added BikeRadar test picks; Lake and Giro shoes not added (no fetched page named models). Shorts and jerseys from BikeRadar and 220 Triathlon tests; Pas Normal Studios and Santini not added (no fetched page). New kinds: Cycling gloves (BikeRadar road and MTB tests), Smart trainer (Wikipedia + OutdoorGearLab; Elite and Zwift Hub not added, no fetched page), Cycling computer (Wikipedia + BikeRadar)."
}